1
00:01:33,020 --> 00:01:35,030
[Forging Justice]

2
00:01:35,210 --> 00:01:37,700
[Episode 11]

3
00:01:39,590 --> 00:01:40,640
Where are you going?

4
00:01:40,640 --> 00:01:41,470
Don't go to work.

5
00:01:41,470 --> 00:01:43,470
Go home and make me something to eat!

6
00:01:44,030 --> 00:01:44,759
Fang Shumei!

7
00:01:45,120 --> 00:01:46,450
Who do you think you are?

8
00:01:46,750 --> 00:01:48,030
All you care about is work!

9
00:01:48,030 --> 00:01:48,680
You don't even

10
00:01:48,680 --> 00:01:50,030
take good care of the kids at home!

11
00:01:50,030 --> 00:01:51,280
You're my wife!

12
00:01:52,160 --> 00:01:53,490
You're a woman!

13
00:01:53,789 --> 00:01:54,979
You're abandoning this family!

14
00:01:54,979 --> 00:01:57,000
Have you ever
taken good care of the children?

15
00:01:57,000 --> 00:01:58,530
Are you even a proper woman?

16
00:02:03,780 --> 00:02:04,590
Mentor.

17
00:02:05,590 --> 00:02:07,320
There's something I'm not sure

18
00:02:08,630 --> 00:02:10,160
whether I should say or not.

19
00:02:10,190 --> 00:02:12,320
Then you definitely shouldn't say it.

20
00:02:13,030 --> 00:02:14,030
But considering

21
00:02:14,030 --> 00:02:15,430
we're parting ways soon,

22
00:02:15,960 --> 00:02:16,630
just say it.

23
00:02:18,680 --> 00:02:19,310
Mentor.

24
00:02:22,910 --> 00:02:24,000
We both think

25
00:02:26,070 --> 00:02:27,470
you should get a divorce.

26
00:02:31,400 --> 00:02:32,530
You are still young.

27
00:02:33,120 --> 00:02:33,820
If you really get

28
00:02:33,820 --> 00:02:35,190
dragged down by that man,

29
00:02:35,190 --> 00:02:36,290
your future career

30
00:02:36,310 --> 00:02:37,220
will be ruined.

31
00:02:44,680 --> 00:02:46,340
You two really are good girls.

32
00:02:48,360 --> 00:02:50,070
Kind, upright,

33
00:02:50,560 --> 00:02:51,360
full of drive,

34
00:02:51,910 --> 00:02:52,910
and responsible.

35
00:02:55,750 --> 00:02:56,520
I believe

36
00:02:57,560 --> 00:02:58,400
both of you

37
00:02:59,590 --> 00:03:01,320
will do very well in the future.

38
00:03:03,560 --> 00:03:04,910
But you two

39
00:03:05,400 --> 00:03:07,200
have different personalities.

40
00:03:07,750 --> 00:03:09,680
I'm not worried about Zhang at all.

41
00:03:10,470 --> 00:03:11,360
But Xia,

42
00:03:12,520 --> 00:03:14,250
I am a little worried about you.

43
00:03:15,560 --> 00:03:16,700
You must remember

44
00:03:17,360 --> 00:03:19,150
that you cannot resolve matters

45
00:03:19,150 --> 00:03:21,150
with impulse or recklessness.

46
00:03:22,310 --> 00:03:24,030
Sometimes, the more impulsive you feel,

47
00:03:24,030 --> 00:03:25,430
the calmer you need to be.

48
00:03:26,120 --> 00:03:27,310
This is a very important quality

49
00:03:27,310 --> 00:03:28,570
for a presiding judge.

50
00:03:36,590 --> 00:03:38,190
Everyone has their own life.

51
00:03:41,280 --> 00:03:42,120
I chose

52
00:03:42,150 --> 00:03:43,240
my life myself.

53
00:03:45,000 --> 00:03:46,240
I have no regrets.

54
00:03:53,240 --> 00:03:54,300
After we part ways,

55
00:03:54,680 --> 00:03:56,410
you two will miss me, won't you?

56
00:03:56,800 --> 00:03:57,280
Yes.

57
00:03:57,470 --> 00:03:57,960
Yes.

58
00:03:59,030 --> 00:04:00,230
Then when you miss me,

59
00:04:01,370 --> 00:04:02,750
you'll write letters, right?

60
00:04:02,750 --> 00:04:03,480
Definitely.

61
00:04:05,030 --> 00:04:05,680
Thank you.

62
00:04:06,840 --> 00:04:07,640
That's great.

63
00:04:08,630 --> 00:04:09,090
Mentor.

64
00:04:10,910 --> 00:04:12,360
You've always been my idol

65
00:04:12,360 --> 00:04:13,220
and role model.

66
00:04:14,400 --> 00:04:15,910
I've already made up my mind.

67
00:04:15,910 --> 00:04:18,500
After graduation,
I'm going to work at the grassroots level.

68
00:04:18,500 --> 00:04:19,100
I want to be

69
00:04:19,120 --> 00:04:20,649
a presiding judge like you.

70
00:04:21,329 --> 00:04:22,240
Then you'd better be

71
00:04:22,240 --> 00:04:23,370
mentally prepared.

72
00:04:24,040 --> 00:04:25,300
A one-year internship

73
00:04:25,750 --> 00:04:27,430
is completely different
from truly putting down roots

74
00:04:27,430 --> 00:04:29,000
at the grassroots level.

75
00:04:31,120 --> 00:04:32,380
Zhang, what about you?

76
00:04:32,480 --> 00:04:33,610
What are your ideas?

77
00:04:34,870 --> 00:04:37,870
I don't have any ideas.
I'll go wherever I'm assigned.

78
00:04:43,560 --> 00:04:44,890
Why are you so obedient?

79
00:04:45,700 --> 00:04:47,360
You never have your own ideas?

80
00:04:48,510 --> 00:04:50,480
Actually, she's got plenty
of her own ideas.

81
00:04:50,480 --> 00:04:51,190
Right?

82
00:04:51,600 --> 00:04:52,600
She's just quiet.

83
00:04:52,870 --> 00:04:53,630
The quiet type

84
00:04:53,630 --> 00:04:55,890
who knows exactly what she wants, right?

85
00:04:56,150 --> 00:04:57,750
-Yeah.
-You're saying yeah?

86
00:05:05,120 --> 00:05:05,720
Mentor.

87
00:05:07,070 --> 00:05:07,600
Yizhong.

88
00:05:08,000 --> 00:05:09,120
Let me carry it.

89
00:05:11,310 --> 00:05:12,040
Well,

90
00:05:13,950 --> 00:05:15,680
we are going back to Beijing.

91
00:05:16,630 --> 00:05:18,090
I came to bid you farewell.

92
00:05:20,840 --> 00:05:22,480
The others have all gone
to handle their paperwork.

93
00:05:22,480 --> 00:05:23,880
I'm here on their behalf.

94
00:05:26,830 --> 00:05:29,490
I'm already very happy
that even one of you came.

95
00:05:29,950 --> 00:05:30,720
I know

96
00:05:32,070 --> 00:05:33,870
that regarding Li Xiang's case,

97
00:05:34,310 --> 00:05:36,170
you were very disappointed in me.

98
00:05:36,760 --> 00:05:37,690
Not really.

99
00:05:37,720 --> 00:05:38,630
At first,

100
00:05:39,800 --> 00:05:41,530
we didn't quite understand it.

101
00:05:42,120 --> 00:05:42,750
But later on,

102
00:05:42,750 --> 00:05:44,150
we slowly figured it out.

103
00:05:48,750 --> 00:05:49,430
You guys

104
00:05:51,310 --> 00:05:52,770
made me ashamed of myself.

105
00:05:53,390 --> 00:05:53,920
Really.

106
00:05:54,770 --> 00:05:56,560
I never imagined you could actually

107
00:05:56,560 --> 00:05:59,960
take Li Xiang's case all the way up
to the central government.

108
00:06:01,680 --> 00:06:02,430
In my whole life,

109
00:06:02,430 --> 00:06:04,070
I never dared to think

110
00:06:04,070 --> 00:06:05,930
I could have that kind of ability.

111
00:06:07,250 --> 00:06:09,400
To rally support, to turn the tide,

112
00:06:09,430 --> 00:06:11,290
and to save people from distress.

113
00:06:20,190 --> 00:06:22,250
I've worked in the court for decades.

114
00:06:22,430 --> 00:06:24,190
I only knew how to go by the book,

115
00:06:26,360 --> 00:06:28,420
never expecting to change anything.

116
00:06:29,950 --> 00:06:30,560
Mentor.

117
00:06:33,430 --> 00:06:35,760
Actually, you've changed a lot of people,

118
00:06:36,430 --> 00:06:37,270
including me.

119
00:06:38,920 --> 00:06:39,870
In you,

120
00:06:40,760 --> 00:06:42,310
I see the conscience, pragmatism,

121
00:06:42,310 --> 00:06:43,870
and human warmth

122
00:06:45,120 --> 00:06:46,720
of grassroots legal workers

123
00:06:47,240 --> 00:06:48,040
across China.

124
00:06:50,240 --> 00:06:50,770
Yizhong.

125
00:06:51,800 --> 00:06:53,060
You college students,

126
00:06:53,070 --> 00:06:54,560
for your ideals,

127
00:06:56,450 --> 00:06:57,360
dare to take risks

128
00:06:57,360 --> 00:06:58,890
and sacrifice yourselves.

129
00:07:00,120 --> 00:07:01,920
That already makes you better
than our generation.

130
00:07:01,920 --> 00:07:02,650
To be honest,

131
00:07:03,260 --> 00:07:05,000
when you voluntarily went
to the detention center

132
00:07:05,000 --> 00:07:06,330
and let them arrest you,

133
00:07:06,950 --> 00:07:08,000
I really wanted to slap you

134
00:07:08,000 --> 00:07:08,930
across the face.

135
00:07:14,160 --> 00:07:14,680
But,

136
00:07:18,390 --> 00:07:19,320
I was also shaken

137
00:07:21,240 --> 00:07:22,070
and moved.

138
00:07:25,510 --> 00:07:27,630
Here are the evaluation reports
for the five of you.

139
00:07:27,630 --> 00:07:28,490
Keep them safe.

140
00:07:28,680 --> 00:07:30,280
Thank you, Court Pres. Ding.

141
00:07:34,040 --> 00:07:34,630
If there's anything I've done this year

142
00:07:34,630 --> 00:07:35,290
that wasn't

143
00:07:35,290 --> 00:07:36,340
mature enough,

144
00:07:36,950 --> 00:07:38,080
please bear with me.

145
00:07:39,500 --> 00:07:40,510
And I wonder whether you are

146
00:07:40,510 --> 00:07:41,909
satisfied with me or not.

147
00:07:44,510 --> 00:07:45,510
Kid,

148
00:07:47,190 --> 00:07:48,250
you think too much.

149
00:07:49,120 --> 00:07:49,780
Have a seat.

150
00:07:53,750 --> 00:07:54,630
This past year,

151
00:07:55,310 --> 00:07:56,630
what have you learned

152
00:07:56,950 --> 00:07:57,830
from us?

153
00:07:58,510 --> 00:07:59,190
Well,

154
00:08:00,270 --> 00:08:01,930
we've certainly learned a lot

155
00:08:02,630 --> 00:08:03,600
from you.

156
00:08:04,430 --> 00:08:05,760
We've learned a lot too.

157
00:08:08,750 --> 00:08:09,950
You're leaving soon.

158
00:08:11,390 --> 00:08:13,310
Give our little court

159
00:08:14,120 --> 00:08:15,380
your honest thoughts.

160
00:08:16,270 --> 00:08:17,530
Our court is very good.

161
00:08:20,000 --> 00:08:20,860
Tell the truth.

162
00:08:21,360 --> 00:08:22,760
Really, it's quite good.

163
00:08:23,530 --> 00:08:24,950
Actually, what I'm saying

164
00:08:24,950 --> 00:08:26,280
is more about how I feel.

165
00:08:27,190 --> 00:08:29,850
After spending this year
at a grassroots court,

166
00:08:30,270 --> 00:08:32,000
I've summed it up in four words.

167
00:08:33,080 --> 00:08:35,240
Abandon illusions. Face reality.

168
00:08:39,960 --> 00:08:40,669
Then...

169
00:08:42,750 --> 00:08:44,010
what do you think of me?

170
00:08:45,870 --> 00:08:47,640
I wouldn't dare to judge you.

171
00:08:48,320 --> 00:08:52,440
An opportunistic old hand?

172
00:08:53,720 --> 00:08:55,910
A rustic old bureaucrat?

173
00:08:57,120 --> 00:08:58,840
Or an unqualified

174
00:08:59,390 --> 00:09:00,390
Communist Party member?

175
00:09:00,390 --> 00:09:01,050
Really, no.

176
00:09:01,480 --> 00:09:02,000
No.

177
00:09:03,720 --> 00:09:05,380
I don't have any grand ideals,

178
00:09:07,240 --> 00:09:09,240
and I certainly don't use big words.

179
00:09:11,360 --> 00:09:12,750
I just hope

180
00:09:14,030 --> 00:09:15,760
that our country will prosper,

181
00:09:16,600 --> 00:09:18,600
that people's lives will be stable,

182
00:09:19,720 --> 00:09:21,850
and that everything in our motherland

183
00:09:22,840 --> 00:09:24,440
moves along the right path.

184
00:09:28,550 --> 00:09:29,790
Li Xiang's case

185
00:09:30,510 --> 00:09:31,510
makes me feel

186
00:09:33,240 --> 00:09:34,270
that this hope

187
00:09:35,480 --> 00:09:36,440
is not far off.

188
00:09:38,410 --> 00:09:39,570
I really wish

189
00:09:39,600 --> 00:09:41,270
I could be a little younger,

190
00:09:42,790 --> 00:09:44,150
so I could live to see

191
00:09:45,320 --> 00:09:46,250
that better time

192
00:09:46,270 --> 00:09:47,480
you will witness.

193
00:09:50,910 --> 00:09:53,040
Isn't there a song that goes like this?

194
00:09:54,240 --> 00:09:56,240
♪ 20 years from now ♪

195
00:09:56,750 --> 00:09:58,840
♪ We'll meet again ♪

196
00:09:59,270 --> 00:10:01,670
♪ We'll raise our glasses
to praise the heroes ♪

197
00:10:01,670 --> 00:10:03,750
♪ To whom will the glory belong? ♪

198
00:10:07,750 --> 00:10:08,790
20 years...

199
00:10:12,120 --> 00:10:13,440
In 20 years,

200
00:10:16,240 --> 00:10:18,040
I'll probably be six feet under,

201
00:10:19,270 --> 00:10:20,360
unable to see it.

202
00:10:25,670 --> 00:10:27,750
But you will be in your prime.

203
00:10:28,720 --> 00:10:30,120
If you ever get the chance

204
00:10:31,240 --> 00:10:32,240
to pass by Nanyu,

205
00:10:34,200 --> 00:10:35,830
be sure to come and visit.

206
00:10:39,080 --> 00:10:41,390
Come to my urn

207
00:10:42,240 --> 00:10:43,240
and tell me

208
00:10:44,670 --> 00:10:45,550
how good

209
00:10:46,600 --> 00:10:48,480
our country has become.

210
00:10:53,360 --> 00:10:54,550
I will definitely not let you down.

211
00:10:54,550 --> 00:10:55,550
Court Pres. Ding.

212
00:11:06,000 --> 00:11:06,600
You may go.

213
00:11:26,870 --> 00:11:28,730
It's time to say goodbye to Nanyu.

214
00:11:30,480 --> 00:11:32,680
Do you believe tomorrow will be better?

215
00:11:34,240 --> 00:11:34,840
I do.

216
00:12:39,200 --> 00:12:39,790
Mom.

217
00:12:43,960 --> 00:12:44,480
Mom.

218
00:12:44,910 --> 00:12:45,550
Coming!

219
00:12:48,720 --> 00:12:49,240
Son.

220
00:12:49,310 --> 00:12:49,790
Mom.

221
00:12:58,440 --> 00:12:58,960
Dad.

222
00:13:03,750 --> 00:13:05,150
Yizhong.

223
00:13:17,120 --> 00:13:18,600
Look, isn't he doing fine?

224
00:13:21,550 --> 00:13:23,350
You don't need to worry too much.

225
00:13:24,480 --> 00:13:25,340
The doctor said

226
00:13:25,720 --> 00:13:27,030
your dad was lucky.

227
00:13:27,410 --> 00:13:28,200
Although his speech

228
00:13:28,200 --> 00:13:29,440
is a bit slurred now,

229
00:13:29,870 --> 00:13:30,630
he can still get his meaning across

230
00:13:30,630 --> 00:13:31,830
without any problem.

231
00:13:32,870 --> 00:13:34,120
I think it's pretty good.

232
00:13:34,120 --> 00:13:36,450
The less he talks,
the less trouble I have.

233
00:13:36,620 --> 00:13:37,670
We go to the hospital for rehabilitation

234
00:13:37,670 --> 00:13:39,120
every week now.

235
00:13:39,320 --> 00:13:39,840
Mom.

236
00:13:41,440 --> 00:13:42,240
Didn't you tell me

237
00:13:42,240 --> 00:13:43,700
Dad just had a mild stroke?

238
00:13:43,840 --> 00:13:45,000
Look at him now.

239
00:13:45,000 --> 00:13:45,800
How is it mild?

240
00:13:47,790 --> 00:13:48,830
Useless.

241
00:13:49,310 --> 00:13:50,170
Who's useless?

242
00:13:51,790 --> 00:13:54,740
Heard you're transferring back to Beijing.

243
00:13:55,440 --> 00:13:56,360
Happy.

244
00:13:56,870 --> 00:13:58,510
That extreme joy turned to misfortune.

245
00:13:58,510 --> 00:14:00,080
Don't talk nonsense.

246
00:14:00,270 --> 00:14:01,550
Don't listen to him.

247
00:14:02,360 --> 00:14:03,290
Du Xiaohui's dad

248
00:14:03,750 --> 00:14:04,360
arranged a month and a half

249
00:14:04,360 --> 00:14:05,760
of overtime work for him.

250
00:14:06,200 --> 00:14:06,910
And on top of that...

251
00:14:06,910 --> 00:14:07,600
Yizhong.

252
00:14:08,630 --> 00:14:10,030
After graduation,

253
00:14:10,790 --> 00:14:12,050
where do you plan to go?

254
00:14:19,550 --> 00:14:21,610
I don't plan to study abroad anymore.

255
00:14:23,510 --> 00:14:25,640
I want to stay at the grassroots level.

256
00:14:34,640 --> 00:14:35,450
A classmate of mine

257
00:14:35,450 --> 00:14:36,480
once told me something

258
00:14:36,480 --> 00:14:38,240
that I think makes a lot of sense.

259
00:14:38,240 --> 00:14:40,100
He said only when you get involved

260
00:14:40,270 --> 00:14:42,120
and participate in it personally

261
00:14:42,120 --> 00:14:43,320
will you have a chance

262
00:14:43,390 --> 00:14:46,390
to change the current state
of the rule of law in China.

263
00:14:48,390 --> 00:14:49,870
During this internship,

264
00:14:51,120 --> 00:14:52,520
I've seen a lot of things.

265
00:14:54,460 --> 00:14:56,990
I think I should stay
at the grassroots level.

266
00:15:06,080 --> 00:15:06,670
What?

267
00:15:07,720 --> 00:15:09,580
You're not going to study abroad?

268
00:15:11,480 --> 00:15:12,940
Is that your own decision?

269
00:15:14,740 --> 00:15:15,690
It's my own idea,

270
00:15:15,720 --> 00:15:16,270
Mr. Zhou.

271
00:15:17,890 --> 00:15:18,720
I know it wasn't easy for you

272
00:15:18,720 --> 00:15:20,650
to secure this opportunity for me.

273
00:15:21,000 --> 00:15:22,860
I know you wanted to cultivate me.

274
00:15:24,200 --> 00:15:24,790
I'm sorry

275
00:15:25,150 --> 00:15:26,210
that I let you down.

276
00:15:29,790 --> 00:15:30,960
Why would I be let down?

277
00:15:30,960 --> 00:15:31,910
I'm very happy.

278
00:15:32,670 --> 00:15:33,320
Happy?

279
00:15:35,390 --> 00:15:36,320
You know,

280
00:15:37,510 --> 00:15:39,040
you really are a lot like me.

281
00:15:40,000 --> 00:15:42,060
You keep your decisions to yourself,

282
00:15:42,240 --> 00:15:43,390
but once you've made up your mind,

283
00:15:43,390 --> 00:15:44,840
nothing can stop you.

284
00:15:47,480 --> 00:15:49,840
I've already explained to the department.

285
00:15:49,840 --> 00:15:51,170
I want to go to Binjiang.

286
00:15:52,670 --> 00:15:53,240
Come on.

287
00:15:54,120 --> 00:15:54,650
Yizhong.

288
00:15:55,200 --> 00:15:55,860
Have a seat.

289
00:15:59,390 --> 00:16:00,920
After a year of internship,

290
00:16:02,000 --> 00:16:02,860
you've grown up

291
00:16:03,360 --> 00:16:04,200
and matured.

292
00:16:05,440 --> 00:16:06,970
A person's self-awareness

293
00:16:08,120 --> 00:16:08,870
and life direction

294
00:16:08,870 --> 00:16:10,200
are naturally dynamic.

295
00:16:11,360 --> 00:16:12,510
They're constantly being revised

296
00:16:12,510 --> 00:16:13,570
and recalibrated.

297
00:16:14,030 --> 00:16:15,890
An excellent legal professional

298
00:16:16,510 --> 00:16:18,370
needs rich practical experience

299
00:16:18,390 --> 00:16:20,250
and an accurate sense of reality.

300
00:16:20,320 --> 00:16:21,240
These

301
00:16:21,630 --> 00:16:22,510
are things

302
00:16:23,120 --> 00:16:24,580
that cannot be cultivated

303
00:16:25,000 --> 00:16:26,400
at school or even abroad.

304
00:16:28,030 --> 00:16:30,200
Don't worry
about the overseas study opportunity.

305
00:16:30,200 --> 00:16:31,130
The opportunity

306
00:16:31,300 --> 00:16:32,360
won't go to waste.

307
00:16:32,870 --> 00:16:34,000
Thank you, Mr. Zhou.

308
00:16:34,480 --> 00:16:35,030
Danke.

309
00:16:36,120 --> 00:16:36,920
Bitte, bitte.

310
00:16:39,200 --> 00:16:41,120
Before Mr. Yuan went on his business trip,

311
00:16:41,120 --> 00:16:43,120
he kept reminding us about it.

312
00:16:43,750 --> 00:16:45,950
You're welcome to join Dafang Law Firm,

313
00:16:46,030 --> 00:16:47,500
but have you really made up your mind?

314
00:16:47,500 --> 00:16:48,910
I've already talked it over with Mr. Yuan.

315
00:16:48,910 --> 00:16:50,310
I just want to be a lawyer.

316
00:16:53,270 --> 00:16:54,200
I'm Lu.

317
00:16:54,360 --> 00:16:55,910
We'll be colleagues from now on.

318
00:16:55,910 --> 00:16:56,840
Nice to meet you.

319
00:16:56,910 --> 00:16:58,370
Hope we can get along well.

320
00:17:01,750 --> 00:17:02,910
Have some water.

321
00:17:05,550 --> 00:17:06,400
I know that.

322
00:17:06,640 --> 00:17:07,599
But are you sure

323
00:17:07,880 --> 00:17:09,240
you want to work as a lawyer

324
00:17:09,240 --> 00:17:10,500
at our Dafang Law Firm?

325
00:17:11,000 --> 00:17:12,000
Why do I feel like

326
00:17:12,960 --> 00:17:14,440
you're hinting at something?

327
00:17:14,440 --> 00:17:15,480
I'll be straightforward.

328
00:17:15,480 --> 00:17:17,200
You won't make money working here.

329
00:17:17,200 --> 00:17:18,660
You know Mr. Yuan's style.

330
00:17:19,510 --> 00:17:20,109
I know.

331
00:17:20,480 --> 00:17:21,550
Keep fighting
even after repeated defeats, right?

332
00:17:21,550 --> 00:17:22,839
That's nothing.

333
00:17:23,200 --> 00:17:24,200
The real problem is

334
00:17:24,200 --> 00:17:26,260
that he doesn't charge for his cases.

335
00:17:27,030 --> 00:17:28,510
You're looking at this one-sidedly,
aren't you?

336
00:17:28,510 --> 00:17:29,790
Sometimes, for a lawyer,

337
00:17:29,790 --> 00:17:31,200
influence is also valuable.

338
00:17:31,200 --> 00:17:32,680
That's exactly what makes it worse.

339
00:17:32,680 --> 00:17:33,570
His influence

340
00:17:33,920 --> 00:17:34,900
doesn't make money.

341
00:17:34,900 --> 00:17:36,230
It even costs him money.

342
00:17:36,750 --> 00:17:38,240
Lots of people come to him
for public-interest cases

343
00:17:38,240 --> 00:17:39,770
because of his reputation.

344
00:17:39,890 --> 00:17:40,920
The win rate is low,

345
00:17:40,920 --> 00:17:42,380
and the clients don't pay.

346
00:17:43,680 --> 00:17:44,280
It's fine.

347
00:17:44,640 --> 00:17:45,480
That's his loss.

348
00:17:45,480 --> 00:17:46,400
Just don't let it stop us

349
00:17:46,400 --> 00:17:47,440
from using his influence

350
00:17:47,440 --> 00:17:48,240
to make money.

351
00:17:48,590 --> 00:17:49,350
No wonder

352
00:17:50,200 --> 00:17:50,930
Mr. Yuan said

353
00:17:51,030 --> 00:17:52,270
you're the most optimistic person

354
00:17:52,270 --> 00:17:53,110
he's ever met.

355
00:17:54,510 --> 00:17:56,770
That's pretty much my only good quality.

356
00:17:57,320 --> 00:17:57,960
The main thing is

357
00:17:57,960 --> 00:17:59,760
that we don't make money either.

358
00:17:59,830 --> 00:18:01,270
He often asks everyone in the firm

359
00:18:01,270 --> 00:18:02,330
to work on his case.

360
00:18:05,680 --> 00:18:07,070
That's a bit of a problem.

361
00:18:07,070 --> 00:18:07,510
Well,

362
00:18:07,750 --> 00:18:09,070
you're still working with him?

363
00:18:09,070 --> 00:18:10,400
I've already resigned.

364
00:18:10,830 --> 00:18:12,240
Today is my last day.

365
00:18:14,070 --> 00:18:15,190
So are you sure

366
00:18:15,720 --> 00:18:17,450
you still want to join the firm?

367
00:18:20,240 --> 00:18:21,300
Thanks, Mr. Zhang.

368
00:18:21,920 --> 00:18:22,640
Then,

369
00:18:26,110 --> 00:18:27,750
on behalf of Dafang Law Firm,

370
00:18:28,200 --> 00:18:29,600
I bid you a warm farewell.

371
00:18:31,830 --> 00:18:33,230
I'll sit here from now on.

372
00:18:33,590 --> 00:18:35,720
I'll sit here from now on. Is that okay?

373
00:18:48,030 --> 00:18:48,960
Great, Yizhong.

374
00:18:49,310 --> 00:18:51,110
This solves a big problem for us.

375
00:18:51,590 --> 00:18:52,270
Binjiang

376
00:18:52,880 --> 00:18:53,790
has been urgently asking us for people,

377
00:18:53,790 --> 00:18:55,480
and the department
has been worried about it.

378
00:18:55,480 --> 00:18:56,030
Look,

379
00:18:56,550 --> 00:18:58,350
first Xia Yingjie volunteered to go there,

380
00:18:58,350 --> 00:18:59,270
and now you.

381
00:19:00,070 --> 00:19:01,240
Did you two plan this together?

382
00:19:01,240 --> 00:19:02,920
Xia Yingjie was assigned to Binjiang?

383
00:19:02,920 --> 00:19:03,440
Yes.

384
00:19:04,400 --> 00:19:05,730
So who influenced whom?

385
00:19:05,830 --> 00:19:06,890
She influenced me.

386
00:19:07,680 --> 00:19:09,070
Get Yu Gaoyuan for me!

387
00:19:10,640 --> 00:19:11,590
This kid...

388
00:19:13,030 --> 00:19:14,830
I am so surprised.

389
00:19:15,310 --> 00:19:15,880
I never imagined

390
00:19:15,880 --> 00:19:17,550
he would actually agree to go to Binjiang.

391
00:19:17,550 --> 00:19:18,550
I thought all he cared about

392
00:19:18,550 --> 00:19:19,110
was staying

393
00:19:19,110 --> 00:19:20,240
in Beijing.

394
00:19:21,480 --> 00:19:22,810
I even asked him before,

395
00:19:22,850 --> 00:19:24,110
and he kept it a secret.

396
00:19:26,000 --> 00:19:27,590
I'm so happy.

397
00:19:28,880 --> 00:19:29,720
Xia Yingjie!

398
00:19:39,070 --> 00:19:39,720
You two talk.

399
00:19:39,720 --> 00:19:41,000
I'm going to return these books first.

400
00:19:41,000 --> 00:19:41,440
Okay.

401
00:19:43,720 --> 00:19:44,750
Let me tell you a piece of good news.

402
00:19:44,750 --> 00:19:45,640
What good news?

403
00:19:47,400 --> 00:19:48,240
Let me guess.

404
00:19:49,270 --> 00:19:51,350
You've got everything set
for studying abroad,

405
00:19:51,350 --> 00:19:51,920
right?

406
00:19:52,110 --> 00:19:52,720
No.

407
00:19:53,200 --> 00:19:54,060
Then what is it?

408
00:19:54,350 --> 00:19:55,790
I'm not going to study abroad.

409
00:19:55,790 --> 00:19:56,790
You're not going?

410
00:19:56,830 --> 00:19:57,920
I'm going to Binjiang.

411
00:19:57,920 --> 00:19:58,860
Really?

412
00:19:59,110 --> 00:19:59,910
That's great!

413
00:19:59,940 --> 00:20:02,340
Yu Gaoyuan and I
are also going to Binjiang.

414
00:20:03,200 --> 00:20:03,880
R-Really?

415
00:20:08,290 --> 00:20:08,890
That's...

416
00:20:09,920 --> 00:20:10,550
great.

417
00:20:10,630 --> 00:20:11,260
Right?

418
00:20:13,440 --> 00:20:15,310
But why aren't you going to study abroad?

419
00:20:15,310 --> 00:20:17,040
Is it because of your dad again?

420
00:20:18,000 --> 00:20:20,000
It has nothing to do with my dad. I...

421
00:20:20,880 --> 00:20:22,880
I just want to go to Binjiang myself.

422
00:20:24,690 --> 00:20:26,200
So are you going to the court

423
00:20:26,200 --> 00:20:27,460
or the procuratorate?

424
00:20:27,600 --> 00:20:28,350
Both Yu Gaoyuan and I

425
00:20:28,350 --> 00:20:30,410
are going to the Intermediate Court.

426
00:20:30,980 --> 00:20:32,840
Both of you are going to the court?

427
00:20:33,680 --> 00:20:34,640
I'm going to...

428
00:20:36,640 --> 00:20:37,680
Where am I going?

429
00:20:37,700 --> 00:20:38,560
I forgot to ask the teacher.

430
00:20:38,560 --> 00:20:39,680
I'll go back and ask him.

431
00:20:39,680 --> 00:20:40,160
You...

432
00:20:56,150 --> 00:20:56,920
Shoot it! Shoot it!

433
00:20:56,920 --> 00:20:57,520
Go, go, go!

434
00:20:57,750 --> 00:20:59,680
-Nice shot!
-Great!

435
00:21:01,070 --> 00:21:01,750
Yu Gaoyuan!

436
00:21:07,160 --> 00:21:08,070
Nice shot!

437
00:21:14,550 --> 00:21:15,680
Why are you so happy?

438
00:21:17,840 --> 00:21:19,100
Why didn't you tell me?

439
00:21:19,110 --> 00:21:19,910
Tell you what?

440
00:21:20,560 --> 00:21:21,550
I already saw your assignment result

441
00:21:21,550 --> 00:21:22,880
at Mr. Hu's office.

442
00:21:24,590 --> 00:21:25,920
Court or procuratorate?

443
00:21:25,920 --> 00:21:27,380
Court. We'll be together.

444
00:21:28,880 --> 00:21:30,740
Did you keep it from me on purpose?

445
00:21:31,920 --> 00:21:33,030
What does "we'll be together" mean?

446
00:21:33,030 --> 00:21:34,350
Aren't you going to Binjiang?

447
00:21:34,350 --> 00:21:35,610
I am going to Binjiang.

448
00:21:39,070 --> 00:21:41,550
Binjiang Intermediate People's Court.

449
00:21:48,750 --> 00:21:50,080
Are you sure? Binjiang?

450
00:22:01,880 --> 00:22:02,590
Yu!

451
00:22:04,240 --> 00:22:05,030
Yu!

452
00:22:05,750 --> 00:22:07,640
Stop chatting! They've overtaken us!

453
00:22:07,640 --> 00:22:08,200
Yu!

454
00:22:08,440 --> 00:22:09,550
Binjiang, right?

455
00:22:11,830 --> 00:22:12,440
Yu!

456
00:22:30,400 --> 00:22:31,260
Have some eggs.

457
00:22:31,640 --> 00:22:32,000
Mr. Hu,

458
00:22:32,000 --> 00:22:33,530
could I have a word with you?

459
00:22:34,750 --> 00:22:35,270
Sorry, ma'am.

460
00:22:35,270 --> 00:22:36,930
Sorry to interrupt your meal.

461
00:22:38,920 --> 00:22:40,050
Let's talk outside.

462
00:22:40,480 --> 00:22:41,810
You two go ahead and eat.

463
00:22:44,590 --> 00:22:45,200
Gaoyuan,

464
00:22:46,270 --> 00:22:48,270
this is the department's decision.

465
00:22:50,880 --> 00:22:52,810
Mr. Hu, you are the grade director.

466
00:22:53,350 --> 00:22:54,070
When the department makes a decision,

467
00:22:54,070 --> 00:22:55,680
they must ask for your opinion, right?

468
00:22:55,680 --> 00:22:57,010
What do you mean by that?

469
00:22:57,250 --> 00:22:58,480
Are you saying
I didn't put in a good word for you?

470
00:22:58,480 --> 00:22:59,810
That's not what I meant.

471
00:23:01,000 --> 00:23:02,400
I just don't understand.

472
00:23:03,970 --> 00:23:04,830
I'm the president of the Student Union,

473
00:23:04,830 --> 00:23:06,070
and my grades
have always been among the top.

474
00:23:06,070 --> 00:23:06,800
You also said

475
00:23:07,270 --> 00:23:11,200
you hoped I would join the Supreme Court
or the Supreme Procuratorate.

476
00:23:12,310 --> 00:23:12,840
Gaoyuan,

477
00:23:14,160 --> 00:23:15,480
Binjiang just got upgraded

478
00:23:15,480 --> 00:23:17,830
from a county to a prefecture-level city
the year before last.

479
00:23:17,830 --> 00:23:19,430
It needs a lot of legal talent

480
00:23:19,640 --> 00:23:21,240
and is eager for our support.

481
00:23:22,240 --> 00:23:23,270
The department assigned you there

482
00:23:23,270 --> 00:23:25,470
precisely because of your excellence.

483
00:23:25,750 --> 00:23:26,830
You're a class leader.

484
00:23:26,830 --> 00:23:28,290
You should set an example.

485
00:23:30,640 --> 00:23:32,100
Because of my excellence?

486
00:23:34,880 --> 00:23:35,880
It's because assigning me there

487
00:23:35,880 --> 00:23:37,680
makes your job easier, isn't it?

488
00:23:37,890 --> 00:23:38,830
If that's what you think,

489
00:23:38,830 --> 00:23:40,200
then there's nothing left to talk about.

490
00:23:40,200 --> 00:23:43,000
Is it because of the evaluation report
from Nanyu?

491
00:23:43,830 --> 00:23:44,760
Court Pres. Ding

492
00:23:45,510 --> 00:23:47,310
has always had a problem with me.

493
00:23:50,250 --> 00:23:51,580
I'll be honest with you.

494
00:23:52,440 --> 00:23:53,840
Your evaluation reports

495
00:23:53,960 --> 00:23:55,210
are all very positive.

496
00:23:55,210 --> 00:23:56,000
Then who pulled strings

497
00:23:56,000 --> 00:23:56,590
to take my spot?

498
00:23:56,590 --> 00:23:56,920
Mr. Hu,

499
00:23:56,920 --> 00:23:57,610
just tell me who did it.

500
00:23:57,610 --> 00:23:58,280
Gaoyuan!

501
00:23:59,200 --> 00:24:00,460
You can't be like this!

502
00:24:00,480 --> 00:24:01,700
You're being extreme!

503
00:24:01,700 --> 00:24:02,760
Do you understand?

504
00:24:03,240 --> 00:24:04,900
It will ruin you in the future!

505
00:24:10,750 --> 00:24:12,750
This is the department's decision.

506
00:24:12,750 --> 00:24:13,810
You must accept it.

507
00:24:22,110 --> 00:24:23,110
Thank you, Mr. Hu.

508
00:24:27,440 --> 00:24:29,160
I'm an outstanding student leader,

509
00:24:29,160 --> 00:24:29,960
with excellent character
and academic performance,

510
00:24:29,960 --> 00:24:30,640
so I got assigned

511
00:24:30,640 --> 00:24:32,240
to a prefecture-level city.

512
00:24:33,830 --> 00:24:34,960
What a joke.

513
00:24:35,680 --> 00:24:37,090
How can you say that?

514
00:24:38,560 --> 00:24:41,020
What's wrong with a prefecture-level city?

515
00:24:41,680 --> 00:24:42,270
Chen Yizhong

516
00:24:42,270 --> 00:24:44,270
even volunteered to go to Binjiang.

517
00:24:46,360 --> 00:24:47,590
Is volunteering such a great feat?

518
00:24:47,590 --> 00:24:48,320
Xia Yingjie.

519
00:24:50,040 --> 00:24:50,680
That's the privilege

520
00:24:50,680 --> 00:24:51,680
Chen Yizhong has.

521
00:24:52,510 --> 00:24:53,480
He turned down the chance

522
00:24:53,480 --> 00:24:54,310
to study in Germany without hesitation.

523
00:24:54,310 --> 00:24:55,480
He wants to go to Binjiang, so he goes.

524
00:24:55,480 --> 00:24:56,510
So free and so unrestrained!

525
00:24:56,510 --> 00:24:58,710
I wish I could be like that too,
but can I?

526
00:25:01,810 --> 00:25:02,880
I got assigned to Binjiang.

527
00:25:02,880 --> 00:25:03,570
If I'm stuck there,

528
00:25:03,570 --> 00:25:05,030
who's going to pull me out?

529
00:25:06,240 --> 00:25:07,240
But Chen Yizhong?

530
00:25:07,720 --> 00:25:08,850
He has connections.

531
00:25:08,880 --> 00:25:10,450
Both professors like him.

532
00:25:10,520 --> 00:25:11,590
After one or two years of internship...

533
00:25:11,590 --> 00:25:12,680
After at most three years,

534
00:25:12,680 --> 00:25:13,920
he can transfer back to Beijing
whenever he wants.

535
00:25:13,920 --> 00:25:15,310
Can I do that? Can you?

536
00:25:19,190 --> 00:25:19,960
Don't look at me like that.

537
00:25:19,960 --> 00:25:21,490
Are you disappointed in me?

538
00:25:23,520 --> 00:25:24,440
I'm quite disappointed in myself too.

539
00:25:24,440 --> 00:25:25,720
It's better for you
to see this clearly sooner.

540
00:25:25,720 --> 00:25:27,120
I am quite disappointed.

541
00:25:28,440 --> 00:25:30,240
But I'm disappointed in myself.

542
00:25:32,480 --> 00:25:34,080
Actually, I should have seen

543
00:25:34,110 --> 00:25:35,370
your aspirations clearly a long time ago.

544
00:25:35,370 --> 00:25:37,580
What aspirations of mine
should you have seen?

545
00:25:37,580 --> 00:25:38,030
Xia Yingjie.

546
00:25:38,030 --> 00:25:39,200
What aspirations of mine
should you have seen?

547
00:25:39,200 --> 00:25:40,240
I was too naive.

548
00:25:40,650 --> 00:25:41,680
I said I wanted to stay in Beijing,

549
00:25:41,680 --> 00:25:43,070
while you said you wanted to stay
in Binjiang.

550
00:25:43,070 --> 00:25:43,960
You knew what I wanted.

551
00:25:43,960 --> 00:25:45,020
I dropped hints countless times,

552
00:25:45,020 --> 00:25:46,480
but you never took them in!

553
00:25:47,750 --> 00:25:48,240
Right?

554
00:25:48,880 --> 00:25:49,510
Chen Yizhong is now

555
00:25:49,510 --> 00:25:51,840
going to Binjiang with you. Are you happy?

556
00:26:16,130 --> 00:26:17,400
I chose to go to the grassroots level,

557
00:26:17,400 --> 00:26:18,680
because I wanted

558
00:26:18,680 --> 00:26:20,480
to gain practical experience
at the grassroots level.

559
00:26:20,480 --> 00:26:22,280
It had nothing to do with anyone.

560
00:26:24,790 --> 00:26:25,520
Well, she...

561
00:26:26,110 --> 00:26:27,790
We just got assigned to the same place,

562
00:26:27,790 --> 00:26:28,240
so...

563
00:26:29,250 --> 00:26:30,530
I get it. I get it.

564
00:26:31,240 --> 00:26:32,000
Originally,

565
00:26:32,880 --> 00:26:34,450
your purpose was quite simple.

566
00:26:34,450 --> 00:26:35,720
Since things turned out that way
by accident,

567
00:26:35,720 --> 00:26:37,510
you thought you could take advantage
of the situation.

568
00:26:37,510 --> 00:26:38,960
But fate played a trick.

569
00:26:39,240 --> 00:26:40,900
Yu Gaoyuan is going there too.

570
00:26:41,070 --> 00:26:42,160
And just like that,

571
00:26:42,350 --> 00:26:44,150
you're a huge third wheel again.

572
00:26:44,550 --> 00:26:45,070
Right?

573
00:26:46,310 --> 00:26:47,570
You don't get it at all.

574
00:26:48,270 --> 00:26:49,180
Thanks, Lihui.

575
00:26:50,420 --> 00:26:51,960
I've been rambling on for a long time,

576
00:26:51,960 --> 00:26:54,220
and you're still willing to stay with me.

577
00:26:54,480 --> 00:26:56,010
Come on, let's have a drink.

578
00:26:57,440 --> 00:26:58,900
Boss, two bottles of beer.

579
00:26:59,240 --> 00:26:59,960
The dorm will be closed soon.

580
00:26:59,960 --> 00:27:00,480
Coming.

581
00:27:00,590 --> 00:27:01,720
How about we go back?

582
00:27:02,440 --> 00:27:03,670
Sit a while longer. You haven't eaten yet.

583
00:27:03,670 --> 00:27:04,750
Put them here. Thank you.

584
00:27:04,750 --> 00:27:05,440
Here's your beer.

585
00:27:05,440 --> 00:27:05,960
Enjoy.

586
00:27:08,750 --> 00:27:09,750
Be honest with me.

587
00:27:11,240 --> 00:27:12,920
You've got to have at least

588
00:27:12,920 --> 00:27:14,200
10% wishful thinking, right?

589
00:27:14,200 --> 00:27:15,480
Stop it. No.

590
00:27:15,750 --> 00:27:16,440
5%.

591
00:27:16,830 --> 00:27:17,270
No.

592
00:27:17,350 --> 00:27:17,920
3%.

593
00:27:19,070 --> 00:27:20,390
1%? 1%!

594
00:27:21,310 --> 00:27:22,370
At least 1%, right?

595
00:27:22,480 --> 00:27:23,030
1%...

596
00:27:23,790 --> 00:27:25,120
We are classmates. I...

597
00:27:25,510 --> 00:27:26,000
Well...

598
00:27:27,560 --> 00:27:28,480
Even a little bit isn't allowed?

599
00:27:28,480 --> 00:27:29,700
Let me tell you,
if you have even a little,

600
00:27:29,700 --> 00:27:31,100
your purpose isn't pure.

601
00:27:31,720 --> 00:27:32,940
If you want to criticize me,

602
00:27:32,940 --> 00:27:33,640
just say it directly.

603
00:27:33,640 --> 00:27:34,830
Don't go on

604
00:27:34,850 --> 00:27:35,880
-about percentages here.
-No, I...

605
00:27:35,880 --> 00:27:37,920
I was just sounding you out.

606
00:27:38,310 --> 00:27:40,970
Besides,
could you bring this out into the open?

607
00:27:41,270 --> 00:27:42,070
And you always

608
00:27:42,160 --> 00:27:43,340
stumble over your words,

609
00:27:43,340 --> 00:27:45,020
never able to express yourself properly.

610
00:27:45,020 --> 00:27:45,620
By the way,

611
00:27:46,310 --> 00:27:47,070
I heard

612
00:27:47,370 --> 00:27:48,640
that because he wasn't assigned
to the SPC and the SPP,

613
00:27:48,640 --> 00:27:49,960
Yu Gaoyuan got a bit upset

614
00:27:49,960 --> 00:27:50,790
and started filing complaints everywhere.

615
00:27:50,790 --> 00:27:51,680
That made Mr. Hu

616
00:27:51,700 --> 00:27:52,500
really angry.

617
00:27:53,110 --> 00:27:53,880
He got upset?

618
00:27:57,830 --> 00:27:58,550
Do you know

619
00:27:59,830 --> 00:28:04,230
that someone in our class got assigned
to the Supreme People's Procuratorate?

620
00:28:06,810 --> 00:28:07,590
I'm not saying that spot

621
00:28:07,590 --> 00:28:08,390
had to be mine.

622
00:28:09,030 --> 00:28:09,510
Well...

623
00:28:10,960 --> 00:28:12,560
You... I'm a student leader.

624
00:28:13,960 --> 00:28:15,510
I might not rank first every year,

625
00:28:15,510 --> 00:28:18,040
but I'm always
among the top students, right?

626
00:28:18,390 --> 00:28:19,310
I think I should at least

627
00:28:19,310 --> 00:28:20,310
have had a chance,

628
00:28:20,550 --> 00:28:20,900
right?

629
00:28:20,900 --> 00:28:21,570
Now I...

630
00:28:22,900 --> 00:28:23,790
I feel...

631
00:28:24,010 --> 00:28:25,000
someone must have been

632
00:28:25,000 --> 00:28:25,740
playing dirty tricks

633
00:28:25,740 --> 00:28:26,800
behind the scenes.

634
00:28:28,790 --> 00:28:29,640
I don't know who did that,

635
00:28:29,640 --> 00:28:30,900
but I just feel that...

636
00:28:34,790 --> 00:28:35,720
Actually, I wanted

637
00:28:35,720 --> 00:28:37,120
to tell you this earlier.

638
00:28:37,400 --> 00:28:38,160
That spot
for the Supreme People's Procuratorate...

639
00:28:38,160 --> 00:28:38,830
Do you think

640
00:28:39,740 --> 00:28:40,880
I should have had a chance

641
00:28:40,880 --> 00:28:43,410
to go
to the Supreme People's Procuratorate?

642
00:28:46,430 --> 00:28:47,490
About that spot...

643
00:28:47,600 --> 00:28:49,110
Y-You don't need to analyze anything else.

644
00:28:49,110 --> 00:28:50,270
Just tell me who you think

645
00:28:50,270 --> 00:28:51,550
might have played dirty tricks

646
00:28:51,550 --> 00:28:52,920
behind the scenes.

647
00:28:58,890 --> 00:29:01,420
Then he doesn't want
to be with Xia Yingjie...

648
00:29:02,230 --> 00:29:04,630
Did you study so hard
that you became a nerd?

649
00:29:04,720 --> 00:29:06,450
You really don't get it, do you?

650
00:29:06,920 --> 00:29:08,120
Just look at his name.

651
00:29:08,160 --> 00:29:09,690
Why is he called Yu Gaoyuan?

652
00:29:09,720 --> 00:29:10,270
I.

653
00:29:10,550 --> 00:29:11,350
Fly high.

654
00:29:11,590 --> 00:29:12,310
Fly far.

655
00:29:12,480 --> 00:29:13,750
Where's he going to fly to?

656
00:29:13,750 --> 00:29:16,150
He's got to find a higher branch
to perch on.

657
00:29:17,070 --> 00:29:18,470
Binjiang can't keep him.

658
00:29:21,350 --> 00:29:23,010
Xia Yingjie is a bit too naive.

659
00:29:24,110 --> 00:29:25,680
I hope she'll figure it out sooner

660
00:29:25,680 --> 00:29:26,720
and get hurt less.

661
00:29:32,750 --> 00:29:34,480
Don't blame me for saying this.

662
00:29:34,480 --> 00:29:35,790
Last time, you helped him

663
00:29:35,790 --> 00:29:38,270
set up that meeting
with the Supreme People's Procuratorate.

664
00:29:38,270 --> 00:29:39,670
That was inappropriate.

665
00:29:39,880 --> 00:29:41,640
You raised his expectations falsely.

666
00:29:41,640 --> 00:29:42,550
Then from the start,

667
00:29:42,550 --> 00:29:44,750
you encouraged Chen Yizhong
to study abroad.

668
00:29:44,750 --> 00:29:45,830
Isn't that favoritism?

669
00:29:45,830 --> 00:29:46,880
We're talking about Yu Gaoyuan.

670
00:29:46,880 --> 00:29:47,590
Why are you bringing up Chen Yizhong?

671
00:29:47,590 --> 00:29:48,640
Well, what makes Yu Gaoyuan

672
00:29:48,640 --> 00:29:49,880
worse than

673
00:29:49,920 --> 00:29:50,420
Chen Yizhong?

674
00:29:50,420 --> 00:29:51,720
I never said either of them
was worse than the other.

675
00:29:51,720 --> 00:29:53,110
You're arguing again.

676
00:29:53,140 --> 00:29:54,920
Enough. Both of them are excellent.

677
00:29:54,920 --> 00:29:56,200
Look at how sensible she is.

678
00:29:56,200 --> 00:29:59,210
Look at you two,
going at it over your precious students.

679
00:29:59,210 --> 00:30:00,000
Aren't you afraid

680
00:30:00,000 --> 00:30:02,260
the fruit you favor too much won't ripen?

681
00:30:02,960 --> 00:30:05,090
Speaking of Yu Gaoyuan, I just feel...

682
00:30:05,590 --> 00:30:06,650
How should I put it?

683
00:30:06,790 --> 00:30:08,640
Lihui and Xia Yingjie

684
00:30:09,300 --> 00:30:10,390
both seem to like him.

685
00:30:10,390 --> 00:30:11,650
Enough. Stop talking.

686
00:30:11,960 --> 00:30:12,790
How come every conversation you join

687
00:30:12,790 --> 00:30:13,590
turns tacky?

688
00:30:13,750 --> 00:30:15,640
How is it tacky?

689
00:30:15,640 --> 00:30:16,750
How did this turn into a conversation

690
00:30:16,750 --> 00:30:17,610
about crushes?

691
00:30:17,680 --> 00:30:19,110
We are talking about work!

692
00:30:19,110 --> 00:30:20,550
I've simply got an eye for details.

693
00:30:20,550 --> 00:30:20,960
Cheng,

694
00:30:21,270 --> 00:30:22,530
keep criticizing him.

695
00:30:23,070 --> 00:30:23,680
Let me tell you,

696
00:30:23,680 --> 00:30:24,960
Chen Yizhong

697
00:30:25,350 --> 00:30:28,030
is just too idealistic,

698
00:30:28,510 --> 00:30:29,910
stubborn in his beliefs.

699
00:30:30,200 --> 00:30:32,260
He's not suited for grassroots work.

700
00:30:32,400 --> 00:30:33,550
He should go

701
00:30:34,110 --> 00:30:35,030
into academia.

702
00:30:35,920 --> 00:30:38,270
In the future, he might even surpass us.

703
00:30:40,000 --> 00:30:41,960
And Yu Gaoyuan

704
00:30:43,510 --> 00:30:45,030
is also talented.

705
00:30:46,510 --> 00:30:48,590
The heights he can reach in the future

706
00:30:50,240 --> 00:30:51,160
are considerable.

707
00:30:51,160 --> 00:30:52,750
Then why did you assign him to Binjiang?

708
00:30:52,750 --> 00:30:54,400
I did this for his own good.

709
00:30:55,550 --> 00:30:57,000
Our country is in urgent need

710
00:30:57,000 --> 00:30:58,660
of talented people right now.

711
00:30:58,720 --> 00:31:00,520
If a promising young man like him

712
00:31:00,640 --> 00:31:02,000
is made to run errands

713
00:31:02,030 --> 00:31:03,230
and waste a few years,

714
00:31:03,400 --> 00:31:05,060
don't you think that's a pity?

715
00:31:05,440 --> 00:31:06,350
What about you?

716
00:31:06,880 --> 00:31:07,440
A few years ago,

717
00:31:07,440 --> 00:31:09,400
when the Ministry of Justice
was being rebuilt,

718
00:31:09,400 --> 00:31:11,030
they wanted to transfer you back
to take charge,

719
00:31:11,030 --> 00:31:12,690
but you turned them down flat.

720
00:31:13,550 --> 00:31:14,410
Do you regret it

721
00:31:15,000 --> 00:31:15,640
now?

722
00:31:16,590 --> 00:31:17,550
Why would I regret it?

723
00:31:17,550 --> 00:31:18,010
Look...

724
00:31:18,290 --> 00:31:19,160
The highest halls of power

725
00:31:19,160 --> 00:31:20,940
are no higher than my little podium.

726
00:31:20,940 --> 00:31:22,240
I've spent my whole life

727
00:31:22,240 --> 00:31:23,720
debating legal theories and statutes
with you old fellow.

728
00:31:23,720 --> 00:31:24,920
I've grown used to it.

729
00:31:25,450 --> 00:31:26,280
But Yu Gaoyuan

730
00:31:26,310 --> 00:31:27,510
is different from us.

731
00:31:28,310 --> 00:31:30,310
As long as he keeps his head straight,

732
00:31:30,310 --> 00:31:31,480
with his abilities,

733
00:31:31,480 --> 00:31:33,040
the higher-ups will sooner or later

734
00:31:33,040 --> 00:31:34,170
make him a model

735
00:31:34,200 --> 00:31:35,460
and transfer him back.

736
00:31:35,480 --> 00:31:36,940
I'm just afraid that he...

737
00:31:38,510 --> 00:31:39,110
Forget it.

738
00:31:39,590 --> 00:31:41,240
Has he talked to you about it?

739
00:31:41,960 --> 00:31:42,640
He...

740
00:31:43,790 --> 00:31:45,050
doesn't have the guts.

741
00:31:45,220 --> 00:31:46,400
Let me tell you, that's exactly

742
00:31:46,400 --> 00:31:48,130
what I look down on him most for.

743
00:31:56,280 --> 00:31:57,880
What are you spacing out for?

744
00:32:00,270 --> 00:32:01,960
He is just like Julien Sorel.

745
00:32:02,030 --> 00:32:03,030
Give it up.

746
00:32:14,830 --> 00:32:16,760
So it's just Binjiang. No big deal.

747
00:32:17,750 --> 00:32:18,350
I'll go!

748
00:32:19,270 --> 00:32:19,920
I'll go!

749
00:32:20,630 --> 00:32:22,450
Y-You put your hands down first.

750
00:32:22,480 --> 00:32:23,140
Yu Gaoyuan.

751
00:32:23,350 --> 00:32:23,960
Don't doubt it.

752
00:32:23,960 --> 00:32:25,160
I can still fight my way back.

753
00:32:25,160 --> 00:32:26,640
I have to fight my way back!

754
00:32:30,000 --> 00:32:31,000
Let go of me.

755
00:32:31,000 --> 00:32:31,920
Let's... I...

756
00:32:33,270 --> 00:32:34,730
Let me help you walk, okay?

757
00:32:35,350 --> 00:32:36,410
I'll help you walk.

758
00:32:38,960 --> 00:32:39,790
Take it slow.

759
00:32:40,910 --> 00:32:42,400
-Let me help you walk.
-Lihui.

760
00:32:42,400 --> 00:32:43,590
Hold me. I really...

761
00:32:44,590 --> 00:32:46,190
I really feel very terrible.

762
00:32:47,350 --> 00:32:47,750
Yu Gaoyuan...

763
00:32:47,750 --> 00:32:49,080
I really feel terrible.

764
00:32:49,790 --> 00:32:51,320
Lihui, I am really happy...

765
00:32:51,680 --> 00:32:53,070
talking to you.

766
00:32:53,750 --> 00:32:54,440
Alright, I know.

767
00:32:54,440 --> 00:32:55,100
Let go of me!

768
00:32:55,400 --> 00:32:55,790
Let go of me!

769
00:32:55,790 --> 00:32:57,120
I really feel terrible.

770
00:32:57,270 --> 00:32:58,000
I'm really happy

771
00:32:58,000 --> 00:32:58,960
talking to you.

772
00:32:59,030 --> 00:32:59,720
I know.

773
00:33:00,960 --> 00:33:01,920
Let me help you walk,

774
00:33:01,920 --> 00:33:02,350
okay?

775
00:33:02,640 --> 00:33:03,770
Let me help you walk.

776
00:33:04,110 --> 00:33:05,270
Hold me. I really...

777
00:33:06,110 --> 00:33:06,680
Alright.

778
00:33:06,810 --> 00:33:08,270
Let go. Let go. Yu Gaoyuan!

779
00:33:13,920 --> 00:33:14,780
You're crying.

780
00:33:15,200 --> 00:33:16,440
No.

781
00:33:19,510 --> 00:33:20,160
Actually,

782
00:33:20,810 --> 00:33:22,020
Mr. Hu told me

783
00:33:22,350 --> 00:33:23,400
this noon

784
00:33:24,790 --> 00:33:26,240
that the spot
for the Supreme People's Procuratorate

785
00:33:26,240 --> 00:33:27,100
was given to me.

786
00:33:28,120 --> 00:33:28,920
I wanted to tell you

787
00:33:28,920 --> 00:33:29,680
the moment

788
00:33:29,680 --> 00:33:30,550
I saw you,

789
00:33:30,830 --> 00:33:32,230
but I was afraid you'd...

790
00:33:33,200 --> 00:33:33,720
What?

791
00:33:39,270 --> 00:33:39,680
What?

792
00:33:41,110 --> 00:33:43,790
The spot
for the Supreme People's Procuratorate

793
00:33:43,790 --> 00:33:44,650
was given to me.

794
00:33:51,160 --> 00:33:52,350
D-Don't be like this.

795
00:33:52,350 --> 00:33:53,080
Impossible.

796
00:33:53,720 --> 00:33:54,790
Listen to me.

797
00:34:21,480 --> 00:34:22,550
What are you doing?

798
00:34:29,230 --> 00:34:29,630
No...

799
00:35:05,230 --> 00:35:05,880
Lihui.

800
00:35:06,230 --> 00:35:08,190
I heard you got assigned
to the Supreme People's Procuratorate.

801
00:35:08,190 --> 00:35:08,840
Nice.

802
00:35:09,030 --> 00:35:11,030
Did you get some special treatment?

803
00:35:32,280 --> 00:35:32,920
Yingjie.

804
00:36:11,880 --> 00:36:12,680
Got any water?

805
00:36:21,240 --> 00:36:21,840
Thank you.

806
00:36:31,230 --> 00:36:32,490
What's the date today?

807
00:36:34,960 --> 00:36:36,620
You drank too much and forgot?

808
00:36:43,030 --> 00:36:44,960
I had dinner with Lihui yesterday.

809
00:36:45,280 --> 00:36:45,680
Right?

810
00:36:51,000 --> 00:36:52,760
That was the day before yesterday.

811
00:36:52,760 --> 00:36:53,360
Thank you.

812
00:36:57,030 --> 00:36:57,880
Zhang Lihui has been coming by

813
00:36:57,880 --> 00:36:58,800
these two days,

814
00:37:00,400 --> 00:37:01,360
checking on you

815
00:37:02,000 --> 00:37:03,130
and bringing meals.

816
00:37:04,070 --> 00:37:05,800
This is what she brought today.

817
00:37:06,670 --> 00:37:07,840
The porridge from yesterday had gone sour.

818
00:37:07,840 --> 00:37:08,700
I threw it away.

819
00:37:09,800 --> 00:37:11,800
She cares a lot about her classmate.

820
00:37:15,150 --> 00:37:16,880
Then are you serious about her?

821
00:37:19,630 --> 00:37:20,760
Serious about what?

822
00:37:22,480 --> 00:37:24,280
Have you forgotten what you did?

823
00:37:24,920 --> 00:37:26,580
I was drunk. I don't remember.

824
00:37:27,480 --> 00:37:29,610
Is there something I should remember?

825
00:37:33,280 --> 00:37:36,840
Zhang Lihui got assigned
to the Supreme People's Procuratorate.

826
00:37:36,840 --> 00:37:39,840
She's the only one in our class
who got assigned there.

827
00:37:42,190 --> 00:37:42,760
I know.

828
00:37:44,840 --> 00:37:45,400
She's all alone

829
00:37:45,400 --> 00:37:46,530
with no family left.

830
00:37:47,250 --> 00:37:49,030
The department is giving her help.

831
00:37:49,030 --> 00:37:50,280
I fully support it.

832
00:37:50,840 --> 00:37:52,300
What are you trying to say?

833
00:37:52,360 --> 00:37:54,160
See? You do remember, don't you?

834
00:37:55,920 --> 00:37:56,710
Since you know

835
00:37:56,710 --> 00:37:58,110
Zhang Lihui is an orphan,

836
00:37:58,670 --> 00:38:00,920
sensitive and prone to overthinking,

837
00:38:01,960 --> 00:38:03,030
you should be even

838
00:38:03,030 --> 00:38:04,320
more responsible for your actions.

839
00:38:04,320 --> 00:38:05,580
Responsible for what?

840
00:38:05,840 --> 00:38:06,880
Don't play dumb with me.

841
00:38:06,880 --> 00:38:08,480
What am I playing dumb about?

842
00:38:10,590 --> 00:38:11,320
Are you really hoping

843
00:38:11,320 --> 00:38:13,380
that I get together with Zhang Lihui,

844
00:38:14,030 --> 00:38:16,230
so you and Xia Yingjie can have a chance?

845
00:38:18,920 --> 00:38:20,510
Why are you making this about me?

846
00:38:20,510 --> 00:38:21,440
Are you here to laugh at me,

847
00:38:21,440 --> 00:38:22,240
Chen Yizhong?

848
00:38:24,710 --> 00:38:26,040
I can't stay in Beijing.

849
00:38:28,070 --> 00:38:30,630
My family is poor,
and I have fewer opportunities.

850
00:38:30,630 --> 00:38:31,090
I'm not like you.

851
00:38:31,090 --> 00:38:32,690
You can go wherever you want.

852
00:38:34,040 --> 00:38:35,440
If I want to return to Beijing
in the future,

853
00:38:35,440 --> 00:38:36,900
I'll have to do it on my own.

854
00:38:36,920 --> 00:38:39,520
I don't have time to think
about anything else.

855
00:38:40,280 --> 00:38:41,510
As for Zhang Lihui and Xia Yingjie,

856
00:38:41,510 --> 00:38:42,050
we are just

857
00:38:42,050 --> 00:38:43,190
ordinary classmates.

858
00:38:43,190 --> 00:38:44,380
We were before,
and we will be in the future.

859
00:38:44,380 --> 00:38:45,380
Same goes for you.

860
00:38:46,150 --> 00:38:46,920
As for this matter,

861
00:38:46,920 --> 00:38:47,710
how Zhang Lihui feels

862
00:38:47,710 --> 00:38:48,550
is her business.

863
00:38:48,550 --> 00:38:49,880
It has nothing to do with me.

864
00:38:49,880 --> 00:38:50,940
Do you understand?

865
00:39:06,920 --> 00:39:08,650
That punch was for Zhang Lihui.

866
00:39:10,550 --> 00:39:12,810
You should take responsibility for her.

867
00:39:23,470 --> 00:39:25,460
