875
00:39:41,380 --> 00:39:42,150
I've got to sprinkle it on
right before serving.

876
00:39:42,150 --> 00:39:44,230
That's the only way it stays flavorful.

877
00:39:44,230 --> 00:39:45,230
Looks good.

878
00:39:48,070 --> 00:39:48,800
Smells good!

879
00:39:58,190 --> 00:39:59,320
Thank you, Boss Sun.

880
00:40:00,230 --> 00:40:00,760
Buddy,

881
00:40:01,360 --> 00:40:03,190
Wang Youxi's wife

882
