888
00:40:13,070 --> 00:40:13,920
Time to eat!

889
00:40:14,910 --> 00:40:16,220
Time to eat!

890
00:40:20,880 --> 00:40:21,670
Alright.

891
00:40:22,030 --> 00:40:22,630
Take care.

892
00:40:22,710 --> 00:40:23,110
Okay.

893
00:40:24,070 --> 00:40:25,730
Come again when you have time.

894
00:40:26,190 --> 00:40:26,630
Boss.

895
00:40:27,070 --> 00:40:28,000
Have some water.

896
00:40:28,270 --> 00:40:28,820
Boss.

897
00:40:29,150 --> 00:40:29,590
Okay.

898
00:40:30,510 --> 00:40:31,040
