899
00:40:31,520 --> 00:40:32,320
It was delicious.

900
00:40:32,320 --> 00:40:33,000
Take care.

901
00:40:33,070 --> 00:40:33,510
Okay.

902
00:40:35,800 --> 00:40:37,280
Take care.
Come back again if you liked the food.

903
00:40:37,280 --> 00:40:37,670
Okay.

904
00:40:38,070 --> 00:40:39,230
