905
00:40:39,230 --> 00:40:39,710
Coming.

906
00:40:40,880 --> 00:40:41,610
And some fried dough sticks.

907
00:40:41,610 --> 00:40:44,340
Sister-in-law,
look at her flirtatious manner.

908
00:40:48,490 --> 00:40:49,410
Dalai,

909
00:40:49,440 --> 00:40:51,280
