910
00:40:51,280 --> 00:40:52,030
Wait a moment.

911
00:40:52,030 --> 00:40:52,760
Chongchong!

912
00:40:53,630 --> 00:40:54,430
Get back here!

913
00:40:56,000 --> 00:40:56,600
Come back!

914
00:40:57,920 --> 00:40:58,450
Hurry up!

915
00:41:00,760 --> 00:41:01,110
Go!

916
00:41:01,220 --> 00:41:02,150
