925
00:41:11,970 --> 00:41:12,590
Come in and have a seat.

926
00:41:12,590 --> 00:41:13,000
Here you go.

927
00:41:13,000 --> 00:41:14,190
We have whatever you want to eat.

928
00:41:14,190 --> 00:41:14,880
Take care.

929
00:41:15,190 --> 00:41:16,000
Come back if you enjoyed the food.

930
00:41:16,000 --> 00:41:16,630
Let's go to this one.

931
00:41:16,630 --> 00:41:18,030
Let's go to this one. Let's go.

932
00:41:18,030 --> 00:41:18,340
Let's go.

933
00:41:18,340 --> 00:41:19,400
Have a seat inside.

934
00:41:19,550 --> 00:41:20,000
Wait...

935
00:41:20,000 --> 00:41:20,440
Well, we have all kinds of...

936
00:41:20,440 --> 00:41:21,100
Have a seat.

937
00:41:21,150 --> 00:41:21,800
Let me just clear this up first.

938
00:41:21,800 --> 00:41:22,280
Boss.

939
00:41:22,800 --> 00:41:23,930
Can I borrow a stool?

940
00:41:24,070 --> 00:41:25,400
I need to borrow a stool.

941
00:41:25,440 --> 00:41:26,710
Look, we've got

942
00:41:27,060 --> 00:41:27,920
