945
00:41:30,280 --> 00:41:31,140
Take your time.

946
00:41:31,360 --> 00:41:32,420
I'll be right back.

947
00:41:32,960 --> 00:41:33,760
Just a moment.

948
00:41:42,360 --> 00:41:43,440
Sister-in-law, forget it!

949
00:41:43,440 --> 00:41:44,150
What are you doing?

950
00:41:44,150 --> 00:41:44,800
