951
00:41:44,800 --> 00:41:45,230
Sister-in-law!

952
00:41:45,230 --> 00:41:46,070
Sister-in-law!

953
00:41:46,070 --> 00:41:46,630
Sister-in-law!

954
00:41:46,630 --> 00:41:47,560
Sister-in-law!

955
00:41:55,400 --> 00:41:56,440
Sun! Sun!

956
00:41:56,520 --> 00:41:57,280
Your wife...

957
00:42:09,760 --> 00:42:10,620
What a real man!

958
00:42:26,150 --> 00:42:27,070
Sun Rong!

959
00:42:27,760 --> 00:42:29,510
I can't go on living!

960
00:42:31,920 --> 00:42:34,840
I can't go on living!

961
00:42:38,150 --> 00:42:38,710
Dad!

962
